、対決しに来たよ！","nextNodeIds":[727320102]},{"nodeId":727320102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":2562234098,"text":"なんだ？「花角玉将」のやつ、また子供と戦わせるつもりか？","nextNodeIds":[727320103]},{"nodeId":727320103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":3197473194,"text":"人手不足だからって、適当に誤魔化したりしてねぇよな！","nextNodeIds":[727320104]},{"nodeId":727320104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13087,"speakerName":"「怪力三十三」","textMapHash":2072410818,"text":"…あんたはどうでもいい。","nextNodeIds":[727320105]},{"nodeId":727320105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13087,"speakerName":"「怪力三十三」","textMapHash":2179258770,"text":"きゃっきゃっと騒ぐやつは、だいたい雑魚だから。","nextNodeIds":[727320106]},{"nodeId":727320106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13087,"speakerName":"「怪力三十三」","textMapHash":840791642,"text":"#この金髪のお{M#兄}{F#姉}ちゃんからは、強者の風格が滲み出てる。{M#彼}{F#彼女}こそがあんたたち荒瀧派の親分でしょ？","nextNodeIds":[727320107]},{"nodeId":727320107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2724651706,"text":"えへへ、おまえ見る目あるな！もっとこいつを褒めてやれ！","nextNodeIds":[727320108]},{"nodeId":727320108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":638647146,"text":"ああッ？何バカなこと言ってやがる！","nextNodeIds":[727320109]},{"nodeId":727320109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":3395558298,"text":"俺様のダチ公は確かに強ぇが、今回は荒瀧派の助っ人だ！荒瀧派の名が示してるように、親分はいつだってこの荒瀧一斗様だぜ！","nextNodeIds":[727320110,727320111]},{"nodeId":727320110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2541991530,"text":"#{M#俺}{F#私}の名前にも期間限定の肩書きが欲しい。","nextNodeIds":[727320112]},{"nodeId":727320112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3747954090,"text":"そうだな。荒瀧派の実力はひとまず置いとくとして、親分っていったいどんな気分なんだ？オイラも気になってきたぞ！","nextNodeIds":[727320113]},{"nodeId":727320113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1006830482,"text":"もしオイラたちの願いを聞き入れてくれたら、オイラも「荒瀧（三日限定）パイモン」とか、「荒瀧派パイモン（臨時親分）」とか名乗れるな！","nextNodeIds":[727320114]},{"nodeId":727320114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":431123082,"text":"おいおいおい！お前ぇら！相手に振り回されんな！こいつは明らかに仲間割れさせようとしてるだろ！これはこいつの罠だ！","nextNodeIds":[727320115]},{"nodeId":727320115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":291870130,"text":"俺様がお前の親分に勝ったら、今の言葉を後悔して、慌てて取り消すことになるだろうぜ！","nextNodeIds":[727320116]},{"nodeId":727320116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13087,"speakerName":"「怪力三十三」","textMapHash":1238309514,"text":"諦めなさい…あんたたち荒瀧派の事情なんて、あたしの知ったことじゃないから。あたしはただ強い相手と勝負したいだけなの！","nextNodeIds":[727320117]},{"nodeId":727320117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13087,"speakerName":"「怪力三十三」","textMapHash":3827688690,"text":"#お{M#兄}{F#姉}ちゃんの虫相撲の腕、あたしに見せてちょうだい！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":727320111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2911604610,"text":"親分の座に何日か座らせてくれない？","nextNodeIds":[727320112]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7273201,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133209112"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REGISTER_DYNAMIC_GROUP"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["13087"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7273201],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13087,"speakerName":"「怪力三十三」","count":6},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","count":6},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1